  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training, advising and practical assistance to the newly founded main-tenance company JMMS (Jordaninan Maintenance Management Systems) with the purpose to increase the knowledge in the country about in- trial maintenance. The project includes i.a. knowledge about the ope- ration, marketing and installment of computerized maintenance system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning, r&#xe5;dgivning och praktisk assistans till det nybildade underh&#xe5;llsf&#xf6;retaget JMMS (Jordan Maintenance Management Systems) i syfte att &#xf6;ka landets kompetens inom industriellt underh&#xe5;ll. Insatsen innefattar kunskaper om drift, marknadsf&#xf6;ring och installation av ett datorbaserat underh&#xe5;llssystem.</narrative>
